{% from "components.njk" import hero, sechead, ctaband, figureSlot %}

{% call hero("Rocket Fund Legacy Society", "Give in perpetuity", "Ensure your support for Toledo student-athletes continues forever — an orbit that never decays.", true) %}
<div class="rkt-btnrow">
  <a class="rkt-btn" href="{{ site.legacyFormUrl }}">Request information</a>
</div>
{% endcall %}

<section class="rkt-section">
  <div class="rkt-wrap">
    <div class="rkt-split">
      <div class="rkt-prose rkt-reveal">
        {{ sechead("How it works", "The mechanics of forever") }}
        <p>The Rocket Fund Legacy Society gives every Rocket supporter the opportunity to make their giving permanent through the Rocket Fund endowment.</p>
        <p>Each year, the athletic department may use <strong>4% of the endowment</strong> to address its top priorities. Any investment gains above that 4% are added back to the principal — so the endowment keeps growing, and your support lasts in perpetuity.</p>
        <p>Legacy gifts can be established through outright gifts, pledges, or estate plans. Our team will work with you and the UToledo Foundation to structure the gift that fits your goals.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rkt-prose rkt-reveal">
        {{ sechead("Why it matters", "A gift with no final season") }}
        <p>Annual gifts fuel this year's team. An endowed gift fuels every team that follows — a scholarship, a program need, a priority met, year after year, in your name or in honor of someone who shaped your Toledo story.</p>
        <div class="rkt-btnrow">
          <a class="rkt-btn" href="{{ site.legacyFormUrl }}">Request information</a>
          <a class="rkt-btn rkt-btn--ghost-light" href="/contact/">Talk to our team</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{{ ctaband("Start a legacy that outlasts every season.", site.legacyFormUrl, "Request information", "/contact/", "Contact us") }}
